\@writefile{toc}{\contentsline {section}{\numberline {III}System Architecture}{2}{}\protected@file@percent }
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Delivered system architecture. The client is a local-first application that owns everything derived directly from the local event log: session logging, the booking user interface, and the client-side Gaussian-process projection and capacity-based booking engine. The Intelligence Service is a stateless Python/FastAPI service that fits a model to accumulated history: hierarchical Bayesian calibration refined by the context-aware shrinkage calibrator, and CUSUM change detection. Supabase is the data hub for authentication, event synchronization, and snapshot storage. The closed-loop feedback from a verified-mastery signal into calibration is Phase-II work, drawn dashed.}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:arch}{{1}{3}{}{figure.1}{}}
